    - target: {fileID: 7011272628108379819, guid: 017273891303ef04f8cbc1bc1a8a064a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "August 17\nPlayed chess with her today. At first, she was focused,
        but sometimes she suddenly looked up, as if listening to something, her attention
        drifting away from the board. When I asked what she was thinking, she only
        looked at that teddy bear and said, \u201CHe\u2019s reminding me.\u201D"
